WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.034 --> 00:00:06.518
When I was a boy

00:00:07.299 --> 00:00:09.409
I always dreamed of becoming a champion

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:13.607
It takes determination

00:00:13.608 --> 00:00:16.319
And a will to win

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:20.394
Even through the toughest moments.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.452
You must keep believing

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:26.963
This is your chance to show the world.

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.092
You are a champion

